== why gate 3 fails: the fix reverses a recorded design decision, and two parameters are unanswered ==
recorded design decision, openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-09-generate-feature-list/design.md:152:
  "**The prose is a model's, and a wrong claim could reach a store listing** → … store copy is written by
   a human from the catalogue, not published from it."
The issue's fix candidate ("a second renderer over the same entry, with the budget as a parameter of the
area catalogue") is exactly publishing store copy from the tool. Nothing in the tree records the budget
value (guidelines/Regulatory.md carries no store field limits and no "what's new" length), and the note
carries no impact signal to order by (tools/feature-list/highlights.json keys: id, area, keyword, specs, why).
